        "original_id": "9ce8aef4-964e-5a77-8fbb-7b1249375b1b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Strauss, Luigi Nono, Krzysztof Penderecki, Joaquín Rodrigo, Igor Stravinsky, Carl Orff\n- Organizations: ESZ\n- Works: Das Marienleben\n\nFacts:\n- Since the 1950s, ESZ has represented Igor Stravinsky and Carl Orff.\n- ESZ has also represented Richard Strauss, Luigi Nono, Krzysztof Penderecki, Joaquín Rodrigo, and the German composer associated with the score for Das Marienleben.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
