        "original_id": "42148a35-620a-50fe-a2ba-99ddf66ff5d8",
        "text": "In addition to Richard Strauss, Luigi Nono, Krzysztof Penderecki, Joaquín Rodrigo, and the German composer whose score for \"Das Marienleben\", Igor Stravinsky and Carl Orff have been also represented by ESZ since the 1950s.",
